cted, use Check authorized access to test them. For a new connection, connect the site in Step 3.\";}i:6;a:3:{s:5:\"stage\";s:13:\"AI connection\";s:6:\"status\";s:11:\"not_checked\";s:7:\"summary\";s:63:\"Confirmed once your AI reads the site through WPVibe in Step 4.\";}}s:8:\"evidence\";a:0:{}s:4:\"edge\";a:2:{s:5:\"owner\";s:7:\"unknown\";s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";}}i:1;a:4:{s:4:\"site\";s:23:\"http://fixible-it.local\";s:9:\"checkedAt\";s:25:\"2026-11-01T21:01:05+00:00\";s:6:\"checks\";a:2:{i:0;a:4:{s:5:\"stage\";s:23:\"REST API from this site\";s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"passed\";s:7:\"summary\";s:72:\"The REST API answers from inside this site with the routes WPVibe needs.\";s:4:\"next\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:4:{s:5:\"stage\";s:20:\"Authorization header\";s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"unknown\";s:7:\"summary\";s:99:\"This site could not make a request to itself, so the Authorization header could not be tested here.\";s:4:\"next\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"evidence\";a:0:{}}i:2;a:4:{s:4:\"site\";s:23:\"http://fixible-it.local\";s:9:\"checkedAt\";s:25:\"2026-11-01T21:01:23+00:00\";s:6:\"checks\";a:1:{i:0;a:4:{s:5:\"stage\";s:22:\"Remote readiness check\";s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"unknown\";s:7:\"summary\";s:101:\"The remote checker did not return a usable report (HTTP 400). Your local results are still available.\";s:4:\"next\";s:95:\"Run a new check from the plugin on a public HTTPS site. Local sites need a public HTTPS tunnel.\";}}s:8:\"evidence\";a:0:{}}}}','off');
